 ucid="JP-9156594-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9156594</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1101927A1</text><sources><source name="APP" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKUDA YOSHIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HONDA MOTOR CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWASAKI TOYOKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUDA, YOSHIHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HONDA GIKEN KOGYO KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWASAKI, TOYOKAZU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUKUDA YOSHIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWASAKI TOYOKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUDA, YOSHIHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWASAKI, TOYOKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An intake A/F control device of an outboard engine, wherein a secondary air path (P) for feeding a mixture A/F regulating secondary air is connected to an intake system carburetor (33) of an engine (E) and a duty control unit (92) to control the duty ratio of pulses to be applied to a coil (76) is connected to a duty control valve (68) connected to the secondary air path (P), an LAF sensor (94) which detects the A/F of the exhaust gas and inputs a detection signal in proportion to the A/F to the duty control unit (92) is installed in an exhaust system, whereby even when the allowance of purification rate of a catalytic converter is set rather larger with an engine output taken somewhat in consideration or even when a set width is shifted to the rich side of the A/F with an emphasis placed on the engine output, the exhaust gas A/F can be controlled accurately to a desired target value.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de commande du mélange air/carburant d'admission d'un moteur hors-bord, dans lequel un trajet (P) d'air secondaire servant à charger de l'air secondaire régulant le mélange air/carburant est connecté à un carburateur (33) de système d'admission d'un moteur (E), et une unité (92) de commande de puissance servant à commander le rapport de puissance des impulsions devant être appliqué à une bobine (76) est connectée à une soupape (68) de commande de puissance connectée au trajet (P) d'air secondaire. Un capteur (94) LAF détectant le mélange air/carburant des gaz d'échappement et introduisant un signal de détection proportionnel au mélange air/carburant dans l'unité (92) de commande de puissance, est installé dans le système d'échappement. De ce fait, même on fixe si le taux d'épuration limite du catalyseur à un niveau plutôt élevé en tenant compte dans une certaine mesure de la puissance de sortie du moteur; ou même si on place une largeur déterminée du côté riche du mélange air/carburant en mettant l'accent sur la puissance de sortie du moteur, le mélange air/carburant des gaz d'échappement peut être régulé de façon précise pour atteindre une valeur voulue.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>